1
00:00:00,065 --> 00:00:01,793
You're never going pro

2
00:00:01,813 --> 00:00:03,890
if you can't read this.

3
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,848
This is the Zero Cut.

4
00:00:05,868 --> 00:00:07,615
The guard sells a handoff.

5
00:00:07,635 --> 00:00:09,378
Watch how his defender reacts.

6
00:00:10,779 --> 00:00:12,270
He follows the ball...

7
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,204
shifts his weight...

8
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,190
and opens the lane behind him.

9
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:18,793
No handoff!

10
00:00:18,813 --> 00:00:19,913
The guard cuts,

11
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:21,403
the big finds him,

12
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,650
and it's an easy finish.

13
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,950
But if the low defender steps across,

14
00:00:28,258 --> 00:00:29,618
don't force the layup.

15
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,990
That help leaves the corner open.

16
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:33,500
Find the shooter.

17
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,470
One cut.

18
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,619
Two reads.

19
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:40,809
Great players don't just run plays.

20
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,979
They read the defense.

21
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:44,351
So...

22
00:00:44,762 --> 00:00:46,820
do you think you have what it takes...

23
00:00:47,056 --> 00:00:48,159
to go pro?

